    "## Volatiltiy is not constant, Vol of Vol isn't either\n",
    "Volatitility comes in regimes, as we have seen from events like volgammed to 2017 where as we show below the VIX we can have periods of high volaitlity, low volaitlity and High and low vol of vol. This is what makes volaitltiy with an intresting asset class, as with large changes always comes oppourinty, however, as I will show later there are large tail risks when shorting volaitlity. Later when I model future voaltiltiy, I will go more in depth in showing the distrubiton of volatilty. For an investor looking to take a position based of a volatiltiy regime change, there is a whole world of intresting matheamtics on identifying regimes."
